@contact_id = 1

### Send Contact Form Message
# @name Send Contact Form Message
POST {{base_url}}/v1/contacts/form/{{contact_id}}
X-Joomla-Token: {{api_key}}
Accept: application/vnd.api+json
Content-Type: application/json

